{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-bukbas-dinosaur-swim-ring-sold-via-amazon-2608-0177","content_id":"5556d8a4-072d-4cb2-968d-aaef61974f99","description":"Product Safety Report for Bukbas Dinosaur Swim Ring presenting a serious risk of drowning. ","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"bfeeab4a-19c4-4154-897a-5389c0413ec0","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-09-17T12:53:37+01:00","id":"bfeeab4a-19c4-4154-897a-5389c0413ec0","title":"Link to Product Image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-09-17T12:53:37+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6aabd4c1f1f8d2a39605f96c/2608-0177-product-safety-report-bukbas-dinosaur-swim-ring.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Bukbas Dinosaur Swim Ring sold via Amazon</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a serious risk of drowning because it has the design and appearance of a toy, and is not brightly-coloured.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The import has been rejected at the border and destroyed. The listing has been removed by the online marketplace (Amazon).</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Hobby/sports equipment – Swimming Training Aids</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>Bukbas</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Amazon ASIN</td>\n      <td>B0F66NV89V</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Barcode</td>\n      <td>X002AGPG9Z</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Dinosaur themed swim ring, or swim seat.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_bfeeab4a-19c4-4154-897a-5389c0413ec0\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6aabd4c1f1f8d2a39605f96c/2608-0177-product-safety-report-bukbas-dinosaur-swim-ring.pdf\">Link to Product Image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a serious risk of drowning because it has the design and appearance of a toy which is not permitted under EN 13138-3, as it increases the likelihood of incorrect usage. Incorrect usage could lead to the child drowning. Additionally, swim seats should be manufactured in bright colours that contrast with the water surface to ensure visibility. This product does not provide sufficient contrast to the water surface to make it readily visible at all times.</p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the Toys (Safety) Regulations 2011.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The import has been rejected at the border and destroyed. The listing has been removed by the online marketplace (Amazon).</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2608-0177</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-08-21T12:47:00Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-safety-report","product_category":"hobby-sports-equipment","product_measure_type":["destruction-of-the-product","import-rejected-at-border","removal-of-listing-by-online-marketplace"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-08-21","product_risk_level":"serious"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-08-21T13:47:00+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-bukbas-dinosaur-swim-ring-sold-via-amazon-2608-0177","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-bukbas-dinosaur-swim-ring-sold-via-amazon-2608-0177","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-bukbas-dinosaur-swim-ring-sold-via-amazon-2608-0177","content_id":"5556d8a4-072d-4cb2-968d-aaef61974f99","document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-08-21T12:47:00Z","schema_name":"specialist_document","title":"Product Safety Report: Bukbas Dinosaur Swim Ring sold via Amazon (2608-0177)","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-bukbas-dinosaur-swim-ring-sold-via-amazon-2608-0177","withdrawn":false}],"finder":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","content_id":"a22b3f1f-2c91-49a1-a469-ff21d465c543","details":{"facets":[{"allowed_values":[{"label":"Product safety alert","value":"product-safety-alert"},{"label":"Product safety report","value":"product-safety-report"},{"label":"Product recall","value":"product-recall"}],"display_as_result_metadata":true,"filterable":true,"key":"product_alert_type","name":"Alert type","preposition":"of type","short_name":"Alert type","type":"text"},{"allowed_values":[{"label":"Serious","value":"serious"},{"label":"High","value":"high"},{"label":"Medium","value":"medium"},{"label":"Low","value":"low"},{"label":"Not provided","value":"not-provided"}],"display_as_result_metadata":true,"filterable":true,"key":"product_risk_level","name":"Risk level","preposition":"that are","short_name":"Risk level","type":"text"},{"allowed_values":[{"label":"Adaptors, Plugs and Sockets","